# Where the frontend reaches the API.
# - Dev: leave unset. Vite proxies /api -> http://localhost:8000.
# - Production: the API's public URL, scheme included, no trailing slash, e.g.
#     VITE_API_URL=https://classtrack-api.onrender.com
#   Vite bakes this in at BUILD time. After changing it on Render, redeploy the static
#   site so it rebuilds; a value that was set after the last build has no effect.
#   The API's CORS_ORIGINS must include this frontend's URL.
# VITE_API_URL=
